title: $:/language/hypergsd/Sections/

# Ticklers additions to the shared Sections namespace (modal + panel sections).
Tickler/AlertDue: Tickler due
Tickler/AlertOverdue: Tickler overdue
Tickler/Caption: Tickler date
Tickler/Description: Set a tickler date on the action
Tickler/Label: Tickler date:
Tickler/Clear/Hint: Clear the tickler date
Tickler/Repeat/Label: Repeat after days:
Tickler/Repeat/Caption: Tickler repeat interval
Tickler/Repeat/Description: Set the tickler repeat interval in days
Tickler/Shift/Day/Short: +d
Tickler/Shift/Day/Hint: Add 1 day
Tickler/Shift/Week/Short: +w
Tickler/Shift/Week/Hint: Add 7 days
Tickler/Shift/Month/Short: +m
Tickler/Shift/Month/Hint: Add 30 days
Tickler/Shift/Year/Short: +y
Tickler/Shift/Year/Hint: Add 365 days